         <title>Masters of PixInsight V8 Scripts v1.6.0</title>
         <description>
            <p>v1.6.0 — Seven scripts retired now that PixInsight ARM ships with the
            legacy JavaScript engine and they run as originally written: Aberration
            Inspector, Canon Banding Reduction, Color Mask, Draw Signature, Image
            Insert, NBRGB Combination and Preview Aggregator. 29 scripts remain.</p>
